{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1439,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5c5b54829aeefb2dcd7a5d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "面白い作りだね。\r\n調べてみよ～っと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "333da50d4db4c79e17c88d1b8c15ebc73d33a1a552c156ce4b84711dfa98150b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb2a926cbeaf3e7afb949ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どこに電子メモしまおっかな～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a36110d415c4652fa0621308fe8325fe21878f63fad28f964aecaf211787d6e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bb15f6c435e76d25bf75625",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れさーん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9103f54580f8fbd821d2d77e512ed81649ede914f5c0728a5b1a88a572b9742e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ec02ea772a44e4b7a0d512d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふあぁ～…。\r\n深夜の通販番組ってさー、\r\nたまーにツボついてくるよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9543412997d42fe96f181fa3743e20e80cf23e649d1e48c8802b3dae170a2466",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f7565576f128cf6b512187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今朝のニュース見た～？\r\nまだならトピックス送るよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce59021366519444395fea17b64b0fc791be199dad3582c76ff6b1b153c6963",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:455a6b384998930c988906e1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さて、お昼に仕入れた\r\n情報を精査しますか～。\r\n鮮度が命、ってね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cff99c192fd817880d563572827027dbdd98ce4c3fc2433b437dc045e406e361",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fb8a34db7e89aef8fc38e4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よーよー、トレちゃんよー。お昼は\r\nウチの見っけた隠れ家パン屋さんで\r\nど？ウケるメニューが多くてさぁ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "827d5cab446dda44a4e970b48ac58e3602ea711fa2e08ba2ea85b28e6445f620",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4d834f0a5807490fd12be24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『深夜の校舎裏にUFO発見！』\r\n…行きたい。けど門限が――\r\nトレちゃん、なんとかならない？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5229c63365b0f5e78037ca1085b87b86473e35c3dfa2ad73bc73d06cdad3da7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:383ab07f7c2f893c1f0f9d8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今からだと、朝までコースか…。\r\nねーねー、動画編集のアシ、\r\nはちみーLでどう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "962beebfb82fb6044711e98280e07d1625a8241a65164be71f511fcbd5c84e46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3921b95e96640710a3c0268",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お花見のマル秘スポット？\r\n知ってる知ってる。\r\nんじゃー代金は桜餅でよろ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93d428ba49ac166163c0bd9059798912eee1477ef06895c95294fae77a509a67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c46bb464601292b0498bd53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏と言えば怪談！\r\nヒエッヒエになれるネタ、\r\nた～くさん仕入れてあるよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1131f5c30bf06460f61927b5604940c7d25b56658b95079e0e1eafa10c1ad5e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4a6e6e5b0ab67f0bdfd3198",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紅葉撮り行かな～い？\r\nトイカメラでどっちがエモく\r\nできるか、勝負しよ～ぜい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef30438cfd1c13f276a9a1e10244745f425862ed8c7eef1c135b4f6a7dd5ebe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72ca0f2b0ce3bde6e474b951",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "う～～、さぶっ！\r\nゾクゾクは求めてるけど、\r\nこういうんじゃないんだよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85ee5266553c30a3ee86a844d1744d357a8c36eed5ff1580db8b6a4344d7ab30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cebcce74c44d5145ba4d52a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヘイヘイ、バレンタイ～ン♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b9de32e8e847af3aa3b85f95f9bd1e6342e6b6008d522ff78dc186cc79374e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5944804d49e6c06ccdb8602",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "フリオ、地元の話してると\r\nすんごいかわいい顔すんの。\r\nあの笑顔、ずるいよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff08cdda5b26b32b49b6f8bd1d4b53cfd8c42eb359c05cdf0396985071371af5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7463ea35858d5b3efd84ccec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "わ、フォロワー爆増してる。\r\n…コラボ効果、エグいな～。\r\nさっすがカレン。カリスマだわぁ",
      "source_fingerprint": "d01b1e319806bc37779dcf305314aa82ca7affcef3d4fd546627add01466dc32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf2f920db26e25daf77c96c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エスポんにあ～んしても、\r\n絶対拒否られんだよね。\r\n次は不意打ち試そ～っと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f8e27983099a69cd5bf214ba8a0e428120b09116fa03a0dabe5ec0cacaa9763",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b56ed0d5af3c9c41cabe7f1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふっふっふ。最強の静電気防止\r\nインナーをゲットしたよん。\r\nどっからでもかかってこ～い…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dceae8200d26add7d66196a7e4e8a38e380d1fa131d5dbc41821683e35b118a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5c2cb8ec8b69294a25cf6dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とーさんたちの撮影現場って、\r\nガチだからゾクっとすんだよね。\r\nそりゃいい画を撮るわけだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78073eac895b14d071a63635c51ea32267ff2a031c17ebacdb71d4c7af0ebaaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96ea9b418970dbdd9685d6d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ダンスのコツ聞かれてさ、情報\r\n渡すつもりが踊ってみせるハメに…\r\nごっつかわいい系の振り、疲れた～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b837fa74f863de6dee1ccdfb956e8fc7a0dfebbcf4832db59b24ff4913da9f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce135290bb00bbf708693866",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ね、この衣装さー、\r\n冷却ファン内蔵させない？\r\nライブ中もきっと涼しいよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcb10499339a247d1db44f3dc2346703cd4ca67e0e7e2c34e5128de499e28b46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8413fd67be981387182f61d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "攻め攻めでいいっしょ？\r\nレースもガンガン行こう、\r\nって気になれるんだよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cecac6c334b9b7e481c85caa510a9bfed8997d727cb8bf0498c210db9e6ea2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e36f4b00b8fc7fd61efae8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このポーチは亜空間に繋がってて、\r\n情報屋アイテムが飛び出すのさ。\r\n…あはっ、信じた？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfbba41ddd023a26803df44450beac798583bf4284f4672a31c956e1bd2acd26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da0412d88a3a198a37eef7f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなが朝トレに何してるか、\r\nちゃ～んとチェックしといたよん。\r\nふっふっふ、できるっしょ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72a536f1116ad4ae49e0cfa4e4df01b4508ba748b15e3e7d6ad0c27e260656df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b786e47e5925f36ddf9f57f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "購買の新作ゲット～。\r\nね、これからおやつタイムとか\r\nどーよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffe7f114b6206343edb9e597a30ccad610a5c6151f8c9a643be2c89cee633872",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9b4ee2acd013f0ad923dfea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キミの走り、ぜ～んぶ\r\n暴かせてもらうよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca4d1e01d2a488cb2b58db4308384671acbb693583d78bcb05a5eefe9d20c88e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b0f406b4dd68f1ef14fc28e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そろそろ情報屋は閉店だね。\r\n寝る前にアキュートちゃんの\r\n生姜湯いただこ～っと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57244d23fca28e49cd281678998ab2a3855d689942982bfa07e55f0956d3ab72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97db4e1c4df42c7872dac02e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "気になるニューフェイスはいた？\r\n来歴、特徴、将来の目標――\r\nぜーんぶ揃ってるよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96db7b8bc9c6b6f18336948251459f6eed56ab1a765584f16acb4cac1823b67c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b3d6fc5777ad88bcc49671a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハンディファン買うなら、\r\nなんでも聞いてよん。\r\nこれまで20個以上試したからさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e23ad9fe2b5d25e383e49027a2d87cd734056a1025bae6baf189a628df4368e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:354a7406fb6a3df85d38876c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ちょいちょい、耳貸して。\r\n…数量限定の激うま焼き芋屋\r\n見つけた…これ、しーっのやつね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "229fa3078e4cb3926dac96bc93f0b163f6d5275e56bba6d4d53c85f7126ca3d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76e85147ade9269cd7a1f789",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんながオフシーズンにしてる\r\n準備、まとめて持ってきたよん。\r\nさ～、研究タイムといきますか～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d740546499c6efedbbaad716bc66e1e259086005d6f103ea8453027c510c4467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b82c32231a8aeb2ec3efbfd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これまでのトレーニング情報、\r\nがっつりまとめといたよん。\r\nトレちゃんなら活用できるでしょ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4ff67ed20097f68d978c08b73e2a6a7f9d5cb7ec3540e8d2a5387d6c0055663",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6841d9f6ea0b512ea582f1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行きますか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca6e7ee0e337e51b6520d09ac6b67f9a3e4b25e3711c8ab015c6b39cf89079e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bb27bf0dd4b50f49d04a167",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "腹筋強化ベルト、バズってるよね～\r\nウチも買ったけどよさげだよん。\r\nトレーニングに、ど？",
      "source_fingerprint": "df96c985ccc3abccfef58e9180074956ca68c4f81eb02df7ec1277176105deb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f2635b10108edd22c31c6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "め～っちゃ映画の話したいけど…\r\nうん、ちょいガマンする。\r\n先にやることやらないとね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb187afb75b775a4b59a26649699fb444c5fa2d5b53be79682ca3b635c4e8ec2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa9baeeeaf06c9775a0fe583",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "併走組むなら強い子でよろー。\r\nトレーニングでも\r\nゾクゾクしたいじゃん？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87d88df9014e876fd7b47ed6a424b15c8d33ef90aaf75400ce1e75095818bd46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df7661371a591e4b9e092500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カバンからスポドリ取ってくれる？\r\n別に中身見てもいいよん。\r\nウチらの仲だし、今さらじゃ～ん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "274fcdb639828831f87de937dc6e316727880b087032c60ac7feec71f6ba1b4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea8781771fb47516a51fdec8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あは。トレちゃんってば、ウチから\r\n目が離せない感じ？そんじゃ、\r\nもっとワクワクさせちゃいますか～",
      "source_fingerprint": "af1d307648124584671e81a524609c23b0b619c41809b7bc7e5693ff02eebe55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5059ebddd3b64db9af80759e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナーさん、いつもありがと…\r\nってビックリした～？\r\n…ま、半分は本音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfdacfe5800ac9a4da2963981cdffc281a3b32131708e1395cb7c97736b1e6cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:960ea813eb30877d72d50f88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海の家のかき氷、勝ったほうが\r\n買いに行くってことで～…\r\nじゃんけん、ぽん！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d0fc739ff43a8576bfb2b0049e0cc6bf9754c747d3147da3bb5e1b998cf19e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ae18f31ca96e75dfce3f54a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うわ、心臓の音やばぁ。\r\nトレちゃんのせいだぞ～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e6d64c8db13e4009a0ada06ebba526d9b67d504dea3ed900aabba3f948e4de0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9920f5472d3877422b3e7624",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うんうん、ワクワクしたよね～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "989ff65de317a48c6cd7c312f233919a04a974e6ebe99ed95ec52ec33a4e05cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d0090acfca466d312359e2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アプデかんりょ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86e3fbc63b440dee6c8ecfee7260908680f9dab345e9c6a9a2d6f4cfed43d3d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5acabbfed17407fc4a6912d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ニューモデルって感じじゃん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bea4714e725cb3f330c365027b5def5558d7b193d73cb7b52e67a81d96e649c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4313acbec8c0211aaba07d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どもども、トランセンドだよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "837c24cad759b323bd1067603624ba9f2a44122f7cace5d4138f8d65f81a5f2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fd2708128d0a1c831a15361",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新しいモノ、見たことないモノ！\r\nもっともっとゾクゾクしたい…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5d222afba815028b71d784b70a8a14aa8ac6c83e34de35650b3eba390005141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441cb10582a894701c6434d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冲啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea9e4fde89d6720f162282db99bf4c2a384ec91c4b23d4f3c57ca3c210fa51a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efcc34329105b071d4238953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老子变强了！就是因为老子这么\r\n锻炼啊！……嘛，虽然也有你那么\r\n一丁点功劳吧。……就一丁点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f31e2e5edeebc0b041a76eb6149238a4514db44c60d6452e140a0729df0b388",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab6213d0d69ccb3028a4e492",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f46af2a01ee48ca4e33b3a34cf3e048d1b6434845e6c847ad9862b65b9774ccf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c7a50a190569e0165f8b5a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcca0a999319539ad9640b8787eee70f6962f780c51356ce460851b0dce71db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53d0fc82afc3a7d19f438256",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你这家伙……和其他大人相比，\r\n大概有点……不一样吧。\r\n……切，我就随口一说！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1625378fb0f6adc4abc849f58d645ef0bac17349ab2728fcd4c1487090ab9b8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51309f64771d7c8f2c98b582",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那些带过路的新生后辈……竟然到处\r\n传我温柔又善良什么的……\r\n这全是你的错，知道吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbf10223197cf089c865ded112cb161a3d8bf5087f8148288570af25b29708ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a44c976dc5905b5af423771f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做了年夜饭结果被吓了一跳……\r\n亲手做那种东西很稀奇吗？\r\n和老妈一起做不是理所当然的吗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ce13ee620d690aa26cb74559f6a74fffda6ea30b7d5af3eb983bc4360e94bf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:742ca36c297ad1c82deef6f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每年都会给家里寄巧克力的。\r\n所以今年也是——……\r\n老爸那份是附带的！没办法才给他的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f71557d0c6105c26de428fadbe2a5634aed8d347f35bcc6892685b428b8b0c00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e3968d57f2800665eef074d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，想吃巧克力蛋糕吗……？\r\n……事先说明我只是做多了！\r\n顺便分你点而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0580f263efec98e94c7fb4f3533e138c08b75a54872fa91782a81e70ce27dbdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:363aec7564dabeeee2ab0ce9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕什么的无聊死了！才没写什么\r\n短册呢，也没写……祝家人健康\r\n之类的……这种事根本不用特意写！——……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0b8b605f9ba13d24c5e110d9e75602ac8344965f1df34a3a87f3d16ea4f37de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95315c856fd8b2126b293179",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被飞鹰说了什么“Live or Treat”。\r\n给了她点心结果她垂头丧气的……\r\nLive啊……作为观众看的话倒是还行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a896cbbb550d6c5b04dce319cdf7f0b20f831725b3f50113a34fe3855adb95a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbbf464c8e28488415ff31a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发现了一家装饰得很带劲的\r\n圣诞灯光。把自己家也搞得\r\n闪亮亮的，超酷的吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d1ae5d9236f44917da4187be0c14054c4e354353abb659d0f39196200d41cc7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2c0430cc175744dc6bfd6d9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，你这家伙……相信圣诞老人\r\n到几岁啊？——啊，我？我一下就\r\n看穿那是老爸了！真的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be1b90178d9f0d78fa8dce4aa9673d6f9a5524f083e3271884471935fdd1e4f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:500946e55eea1945e5f5beda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哟西！",
      "source_fingerprint": "713cd60f0fe94d4c5199336563ad9145f80dd85c5dab0f4e7bf75c5eb6c14601",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7954ed2746c0b49c3c38ade8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大扫除？还在说那种事吗。\r\n哈！！\r\n老子早就爆速干完了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c85533bf1ade3343e04af274e6775ec425c102044d8d32630722d0cf3cfc9a09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebe9f74f3bfd8e0a6114664b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈？你今天生日！？\r\n这种事早点说啊，那种事情！\r\n我都还没准备好呢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "842a52b6e077e91f00d43414d4ba24004a732b4a324c8b8e479e9c96a56c9032",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10679f392642cdd9bbad82cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，看到训练员室的东西了吗。\r\n……那个便当！是给你的慰问品啦混蛋！\r\n你生日对吧，有意见吗啊！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af7ad8eff408dfa05b388670351f77376b9b57c58990c9aa80d177f648e60e54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cf594dd0b21808e76b7db6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吹灭生日蛋糕的\r\n蜡烛，我可是专业的。\r\n不管几根都能一口气吹灭！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b8dd4aa8b532a88e43a4d4dcd89a94ce6fe88a3dd131a19e4fdf40145e5fa55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2283d516e3317e5463ffb67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么你这家伙在那高兴啊。\r\n过生日的可是老子。\r\n……真是个，让人受不了的家伙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "da626a991528317fbac1de090b97e086deca6136b1ea96949379d339263293e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5b9b44c910f8d5bf85146ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，来公告了。\r\n赶紧去确认一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8d96e8b1788604582bd1af66818c4816004c548f4dc235c13be8d65d37ce62f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04ec5642c026d16c1e882df5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物。早点去领了比较好吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbe51df7f407d059da26f87c43b35868992007f6ba898a948144d9145ed8e771",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2922bdc1112600263a853333",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞，任务完成！\r\n轻轻松松！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a86f55617d3bca99861e453939f79bdd042f33a94c732d0f6a17150c1f29ab4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76abfee01fa3775716f3602a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有活动啊……！\r\n嘿嘿，我要疯狂爆肝\r\n拿第一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c459a36282c3838c68437a82e26bc475d0b1b7594eaf227649da4a8db3e85810",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d9b4f7654693b8b8af15d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢啦噢啦！这就去活动里\r\n把全员甩在身后！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75064529bf05c79b248c6ebaf15759396257949d1d5a57482ac9a54ac75b14b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72300f2162d224d0701cc3aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次绝对要把你干碎！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1649b924c771f5618a42b271045a0a09bca341b4cbdee2ac9007ecf133ed6b4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f22b8b9d486a59e4eaefeab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干得不错嘛，\r\n名鉴等级提升了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efd41d002283b1b0c674b7ee333f6eebabff5b991fe38fda19767fa1b1bc975c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0766a9c05ff9b4f232dd7702",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说起强大的颜色那就是黑色了吧！\r\n又酷又强又独立的家伙，就是要\r\n穿一身帅气的黑色才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b244a40229031069727d6db117787c6082a68a62ff0a82145cb1c13b41a71d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:388eb48f87196a9de80fcda5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊——……声音还是很沙哑……。\r\n跟太阳神她们的卡拉OK耐力赛唱过头了，\r\n太激烈了……可恶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90611639b21d504a1797b362a9ff5aed4bb6bec1634a729b441ed16999bc1d5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca45b7e33cdfdbf9620707ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "车站前的平价商店，饰品角\r\n真的很火热啊～。黑金的\r\n颈圈，果然还是想要啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d24655383418e60d36abac1fe1a43e0c1177b5441d9f7986cfab515964c784d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba4b73254eaffae77192f67d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打得挺精彩嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5a7ebff1c4caaf77eeab28d55320add370f9bf17240fdc1831bc436bd2f0e65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d88e13ac046591d5a0e41b8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最强的，就是我们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa86c982b2e6ea73c1f552051388e75f9baa71e4bdf0ec54406479cb1a8b66c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b27428bf4ea3b173bde21636",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次绝对要把你干碎！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1649b924c771f5618a42b271045a0a09bca341b4cbdee2ac9007ecf133ed6b4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5eb293a913c8a00c3392f3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打得挺精彩嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5a7ebff1c4caaf77eeab28d55320add370f9bf17240fdc1831bc436bd2f0e65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3ce03b03388594696d4c69f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样，吓尿了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62454aa290bc6f9c0a3c9e9bc85cad4df8d3c04ece6a4d9d6d81d9c145bc6111",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1081",
        "1007"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
